OL,3,GNEWSADriver seriously injured in
OL,4,Afour-vehicle A34 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter they were seriously injured in a
OL,8,Fcrash that shut a major road.
OL,10,FThe A34 was closed in both directions
OL,11,Fnear Chieveley Services, near Newbury,
OL,12,Fat about 11:00 BST after the crash on
OL,13,Fthe northbound carriageway between a
OL,14,Fwhite van, a red car and two other
OL,15,Fvehicles.
OL,17,FThe southbound carriageway reopened at
OL,18,Fabout 13:30. One lane has been reopened
OL,19,Fon the northbound carriageway but
OL,20,FNational Highways said it expected the
OL,21,Fpartial closure to last for "several
OL,22,Fhours".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
