OL,3,GNEWSADriver seriously injured in
OL,4,Afour-vehicle A34 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police said the car's
OL,7,Fdriver was injured and appealed to
OL,8,Fanyone who saw the crash to contact
OL,9,Fofficers.
